https://desty.github.io/study-tiny-llm/en/part2/05-tinystories/)). Successors include SimpleStories, which aims to be more diverse and labeled ([Google Doc proposal](https://docs.google.[scrubbed:long-base64]?format=pdf)).\n\nThe search also returned unrelated results: a small itch.io game called \"Tiny Stories,\" a \"Tiny Book of Tiny Stories\" anthology on HitRecord, and general microfiction tips. These are not the language model dataset."], "durationSeconds": 7.298674484999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01SKFru4fERhqxEUFvyxdvF9", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "config", "reason_type": "rule"}}]}
